Functional-test maps live here, and only here.

Any map containing an AFunctionalTest (or a subclass) must be in this folder.
Config/DefaultGame.ini excludes this folder from the cook via
+DirectoriesToNeverCook=(Path="/Game/Maps/FunctionalTests"), because
AFunctionalTest's class lives in Epic's FunctionalTesting module, which is not
precompiled for Shipping — a cooked .umap referencing it carries a dangling
class pointer.

This file exists only so the folder is tracked by git before the first test map
lands. Delete it once there is a real .umap here. The engine ignores it: the
asset registry and the cooker only look at .uasset / .umap.

See CLAUDE.md, "Functional-test actors live only in never-cooked maps".
